OL,3,GNEWSA'There will only be one Tim Curry'
OL,4,Asays Rocky Horror star Luke Evans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood star Luke Evans has paid
OL,7,Ftribute to Tim Curry, who has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 80.
OL,10,FCurry was best known for playing the
OL,11,Foutlandish Frank-N-Furter in film
OL,12,Fmusical The Rocky Horror Picture Show.
OL,13,FHe first played the role on stage in
OL,14,F1973 before the film version two years
OL,15,Flater.
OL,17,FEvans took on the role in the cult
OL,18,Fclassic musical on Broadway, which
OL,19,Fconcluded earlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
